  "fullDescription": "Hyperlinked daily, weekly and monthly pages for quick and easy navigation.\n\n• Undated so you can reuse it as many times as you want!\n\n✨ [ UNDATED VERSION ] ✨\n\nFILES INCLUDED IN YOUR PURCHASE:\n\n1 x Size Vertical Fully Hyperlinked and Functional Undated Digital Planner! (60 Pages).\n\n1 x Instructions & Guides.\n\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\nWHATS INCLUDED?\n\nDaily Planner [ Sun, Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri & Sat ] ✅\nWeekly Planner ✅\nWeekly Self-Care Checklist ✅\nWeekly Meal Tracker ✅\nWeekly Vitamins & Supplements ✅\n\n• • PRODUCTIVITY: Habit Tracker, Goal Setting, Reading Log, Movies To Watch & Pomodoro Planner.\n\n• • HEALTH: Health Habit Tracker, Vitamins & Supplements, My Health Goals, Doctor Visit & Blood Pressure.\n\n• • FINANCE: Monthly Budget, Expenses Tracker, Debt Payment, Saving Tracker & Subscription Tracker.\n\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n• It’s perfect for anyone who wants to stay organized and focused.\n\n• Plan your life in style with Feelinfy!\n\nThis planner is made with a sleek and user-friendly interface that allows you to easily navigate through your schedules and tasks with the help of thousands of hyperlinks.\n\nThe supported applications are:\n\nGoodNotes, Notability, Noteshelf, XODO, Samsung Notes, or any PDF editing app.\n\n• This is a digital download product •\n– Your files will be available to download once payment confirmed.\n\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n• Tas Creative Studio •",
